     ruff (line 100, ruff.lint.select=[E,F,I,B,UP,ASYNC]); mypy strict; uv preferred over pip -->

## Conventions
<!-- snake_case modules + functions; PascalCase classes
     mandatory `from __future__ import annotations` at top of every .py file
     type hints required on every function signature
     async-first: all I/O functions are `async def`
     constructor injection via dataclass / explicit __init__ — NEVER global state
     prefer `httpx.AsyncClient` over `requests` -->

## Testing
<!-- pytest 8 + pytest-asyncio (asyncio_mode=auto). NEVER unittest.TestCase.
     Mocks: pytest-mock + AsyncMock — NEVER MagicMock for async paths.
     Integration tests use Testcontainers + real Postgres (NOT in-memory SQLite).
     Coverage target: ≥85% via `pytest --cov=app --cov-fail-under=85`. -->

## Don't-Touch
<!-- Files Kimi (or any agent) must never edit:
     - alembic/versions/*.py — never modify in place; ADD a new revision
     - .env, .env.example for secrets
     - pyproject.toml major version bumps without explicit approval
     - any file whose first line is `# DO-NOT-EDIT` -->

## Commands
<!-- Full suite:        pytest -q --cov=app --cov-fail-under=85
     Lint:              ruff check .
